OL,3,GNEWSASearch for man who fell overboard
OL,4,Afrom Calmac ferry stood down
OL,5,
OL,6,FSearches have been stood down after a
OL,7,Fman fell overboard from a CalMac ferry.
OL,9,FHM Coastguard received reports of the
OL,10,Fincident onboard MV Caledonian Isles,
OL,11,Feast of Arran at about 20:30 on Sunday
OL,12,Fand coordinated a rescue mission with
OL,13,FPolice Scotland, the RNLI, and CalMac.
OL,15,FThe search involved two helicopters and
OL,16,Fan airplane from HM Coastguard. and two
OL,17,FRNLI crews from Girvan and Campbeltown.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
