OL,3,GNEWSASearch for man who fell overboard
OL,4,Afrom Calmac ferry stood down
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Scotland confirmed they are
OL,7,Fassisting partners with a missing
OL,8,Fpersons case and HM Coastguard said the
OL,9,Fsearch was stood down at about 04:55
OL,10,Fpending new information.
